  "主要内容": "On January 16, 2015, Optical Cable Corporation (Nasdaq GM: OCC) declared a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.02 per share on its common stock, effective January 15, 2015. The dividend will be paid on or about February 16, 2015 to shareholders of record on January 27, 2015. This implies an annual cash dividend of $0.08 per common share.",
